  m_Name: ElevatorNPC
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueAsset
  dialogue:
  - I can't get to work since the elevator shut down.
  - I mean I could turn the power back on but I already called out...
  - You forgot where the elevator it is? Where have you been?
  - If you really want to get out of here -
  - Right down the hallway and up.
